 "remarks": "Prospect Grove Condo Complex sitting right in the heart of Stamford. Step outside the building and walk straight to local restaurants, shops, movie theaters, and the library... city living doesn't get more convenient than this. Freshly and beautifully updated, the unit is bright and sunny with a large bedroom, a big open living room, and wood floors throughout. The kitchen has a gas range and white cabinets.  the full bathroom has been refreshed with a new vanity, new toilet, and a newly glazed white bathtub. Even better, the HOA includes heat and hot water, helping keep your monthly expenses more predictable. Whether you're looking for a place to call home or an investment property, this is a great buy either way.",
